#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:2
msgid "Files integration"
msgstr "Comhtháthú comhad"

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:5
msgid "Talk from Files"
msgstr "Comhrá ó Chomhaid"

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:7
msgid ""
"In the Files app, you can chat about files in the sidebar, and even have a "
"call while editing the file. You first have to join the chat."
msgstr ""
"San aip Comhad, is féidir leat comhrá a dhéanamh faoi chomhaid sa bharra "
"taoibh, agus fiú glao a dhéanamh agus an comhad á chur in eagar. Caithfidh "
"tú páirt a ghlacadh sa chomhrá ar dtús."

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:9
msgid "Nextcloud Files sidebar with Talk chat panel open for a file"
msgstr ""
"Barra taoibh Nextcloud Files agus painéal comhrá Talk oscailte le haghaidh "
"comhaid"

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:15
msgid ""
"Nextcloud Files sidebar showing an active Talk chat and call for a file"
msgstr ""
"Barra taoibh Nextcloud Files ina dtaispeántar comhrá agus glao gníomhach "
"Talk a bhaineann le comhad"

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:19
msgid ""
"You can then chat or have a call with other participants, even when you "
"start editing the file."
msgstr ""
"Ansin is féidir leat comhrá a dhéanamh nó glaoch a bheith agat le "
"rannpháirtithe eile, fiú nuair a thosaíonn tú ag eagarthóireacht an "
"chomhaid."

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:21
msgid ""
"Nextcloud Text editor with Talk conversation sidebar open for collaboration"
msgstr ""
"Eagarthóir téacs Nextcloud, le barra taoibh comhrá Talk ar oscailt chun "
"comhoibriú a dhéanamh"

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:25
msgid ""
"In Talk, a conversation will be created for the file. You can chat from "
"there, or go back to the file using the ``...`` menu at the top of the "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"In Talk, cruthófar comhrá don chomhad. Is féidir leat comhrá a dhéanamh as "
"sin, nó filleadh ar an gcomhad tríd an roghchlár ``...`` ag barr an chomhrá "
"a úsáid."

#: ../../talk/files_integration.rst:27
msgid ""
"Talk conversation created for a specific file showing the file at the top"
msgstr ""
"Comhrá a cruthaíodh le haghaidh comhaid ar leith, leis an gcomhad ar "
"taispeáint ag an mbarr"
